  "details": "For example, you want change between 4 outfits: Today, you add an int parameter and set a value from 0-3 in your action menu. But when your avatar gets a little bit more complex, you will reach that point, where 128bit of synced parameters are not enough. For the upper scenario, 2bits would be enough. But that int uses 8bit - 6bits are waste. I would like to have an option, to set more than one parameter in an action menu entry at the same time. For the upper example I want set two Outfit0 and Outfit1 bool parameter instead of an a single int parameter:\nOutfit0 = 0 / Outfit1 = 0 -> 1st Outfit\nOutfit0 = 1 / Outfit1 = 0 -> 2nd Outfit\nOutfit0 = 0 / Outfit1 = 1 -> 3rd Outfit\nOutfit0 = 1 / Outfit1 = 1 -> 4th Outfit",
